# Plantasonic Project

Browser-based generative audiovisual instrument — first proof of the repeatable AI-assisted product system.

**Stack:** Vite, TypeScript (strict), Bootstrap 5.0.2, GSAP. Not Next.js or React.

## Repository boundaries

| External repo | Role | Integration |
|---------------|------|-------------|
| ai-product-framework | Process, templates, Cursor rules | `docs/product-framework/` |
| ai-native-design-system | Tokens, Bootstrap, UI rules | `src/design-system/` |
| plantasia-sound-engine | Audio engine | `src/audio/soundAdapter.ts` — **integrated** (`1.0.0-beta.1`) |
| ASCII Visual Engine | Visual engine | `src/visuals/mockAsciiAdapter.ts` — mock until Phase 6 |

**Do not:** merge repos, copy engine code, import unstable engine packages, hardcode theme values.

## Key docs

- `docs/INTEGRATION_PLAN.md` — current phase scope
- `docs/REPO_BOUNDARIES.md` — ownership rules
- `docs/product-framework/CODING_STANDARDS.md` — coding rules
- `docs/design-system/` — token and component guidance

## Architecture

UI → Runtime → Adapters → External engines. Runtime is the only layer that calls both adapters.

## Current phase

Phase 5 complete — sound engine integrated via adapter. Do not integrate ASCII engine until Phase 6.
